OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist seriously hurt in
OL,4,Acrash with lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lorry driver has been arrested after
OL,7,Fa crash left a motorcyclist with
OL,8,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,10,FA red Volvo lorry heading northbound
OL,11,Fcrashed with a black Kawasaki motorbike
OL,12,Fheading in the opposite direction on
OL,13,Fthe B1043 Old North Road in Sawtry,
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, at about 12:50 BST on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist, a man, 23, from
OL,18,FYaxley, near Peterborough, was taken to
OL,19,FAddenbrooke's Hospital in Cambridge
OL,20,Fwhere he remained.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
