OL,4,Acrash with lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the HGV, a man, 76, from
OL,7,FWisbech, was uninjured and arrested at
OL,8,Fthe scene on suspicion of causing
OL,9,Fserious injury by careless driving. He
OL,10,Fwas later released on bail.
